SUMMARY:Harsh Computer - Live experimental computermusic and noise
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
DTSTART:20261009T180000Z
DTEND:20261009T180000Z
DESCRIPTION:Venta Protesix is the solo project of Italo Belladonna active s
 ince 2008. Always considered as one of the most controversial personalitie
 s of the entire panorama of experimental music in Italy\, for over ten yea
 rs he has been moving within the most extreme computer music with performa
 nces all over Europe and Asia where he conveys a constant sensation of psy
 choacoustic discomfort to his listeners through live sets of digital harsh
  noise with strong impact. Sjoerd Juxtathe world wide web is full of (un)f
 ound footage \, distorted remnants of unfinished projects\, audio files fr
 om forgotten games\, cryptic symbols\, redundant information and security 
 camera livestreams with zero watchers. a world that is there but rarely pe
 rceived and almost intimate when perceived through the screen\, but no one
  will know you are there. gazing into the abyss\, an empty room. audiovisu
 al performance that explores dissociation and disconnectedness through dig
 ital archeology portraying the emptiness of online places. video with 4 de
 ck dj playing soundfiles from my collected sound archive slow_girlsharsh d
 atabending audio corruption Free entrancecash preferred
LOCATION:Vondelbunker Vondelpark 8a  Amsterdam Pays-Bas
URL:https://radar.squat.net/en/node/596392
CATEGORIES:music/concert
END:VEVENT
