DTSTAMP:20261006T023755Z
SUMMARY:HackFest 2026
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261010
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261011
DESCRIPTION:HackFest aims to make technology and knowledge accessible to\ne
 veryone\, promotes creativity and stimulates both social and\neconomic inn
 ovation. On Saturday 10 Oktober 2026\, Hackfest gives\na platform to a div
 erse group of creative minds\, hackers\,\ninventors\, designers\, artists\
 , engineers\, developers and\nhobbyists to showcase their projects in an i
 nspiring space.\n\nThese enthusiastic makers come to Hackfest to present t
 heir\ncreations and share their discoveries with the public. The event\nbr
 ings together curious people who enjoy learning and sharing\ntheir skills 
 through lectures and workshops and working on their\nown projects on site.
  It is a place where people are amazed by\ninstallations\, original do-it-
 yourself projects\, fascinating\ndiscoveries and innovative solutions.\n\n
 Hackfest puts these projects in the spotlight and provides a\nplatform for
  original ideas.\n
LOCATION:Enschede\, Netherlands
URL:https://hackfest.nl/
CATEGORIES:exposition\,maker
END:VEVENT
