SUMMARY:proxycafe - RISE AGAINST BIG TECH
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
DTSTART:20261021T170000Z
DTEND:20261021T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:We are living inside a sci-fi book. Which narrative of resistan
 ce are we going to write? In this talk we want to open a discussion\, talk
  about the resistance to big tech. Which kind of alternatives are we worki
 ng on? https://riseagainstbig.tech/ Proxycafe\, free software workshops. D
 iscussing tech and politics\, GNU/Linux\, fixing computers and revive old 
 laptops\, free and opensource software workshops. Zapatista coffee. Timeli
 ne: - 19:00 doors open\, possible snacks\, pizza. (Joe's already open from
  15:00 to 19:00 with the Joe's Salon) - 20:00 talk/discussion starts - 21:
 00 talk/discussion ends - 22:00 good night https://proxycafe.puscii.nl/
LOCATION:Joe's Garage Pretoriusstraat 43  Amsterdam Pays-Bas
URL:https://radar.squat.net/en/proxycafe-rise-against-big-tech
CATEGORIES:discussion/presentation
END:VEVENT
